  },
  {
    "id": "c008",
    "name": "7. No Other Rights; Termination",
    "text": "The transfer of the Material grants te Recipient no rights In the Material other than those specifically set forth in the Agreement. Thls agreement may be terminated • upon thirty (30) clays written notice by either party to the other. Upon termination of 332 N,34-t1 Liwddnk Stre\". mcinoli::. TN .1 ,3105 2 .7 '.)4 I 1901 .49;! . .DIM Iwww.Ykitorl,'. 1 2 • the agreement, Recipient shall destroyall unused Materials."
